('ENT_SET_SAMBLO','Samblo','Sethian','Angelic minister','Angelic Being','Samblo; ministry of the four luminaries','Sethian','2nd-3rd c. CE','A','candidate_verified_name','Nag Hammadi primary attestation (NHC III,2)',1,false,false,'One of the four ministers of the four luminaries (with Gamaliel, Gabriel, Abrasax) in the Gospel of the Egyptians (NHC III,2).','angel'),
