('ENT_SET_MICHEUS','Micheus','Sethian','Baptismal power','Angelic Being','baptism; living water; spring of truth','Sethian','2nd-3rd c. CE','A','candidate_verified_name','Nag Hammadi primary attestation (NHC III,2)',1,false,false,'Sethian baptismal power over the holy baptism and living water (paired with Michar) in the Gospel of the Egyptians (NHC III,2).','spirit'),
