('ENT_SET_ATHOTH','Athoth','Sethian','Archon','Archon','archon; rulership','Sethian','2nd-3rd c. CE','A','candidate_verified_name','Nag Hammadi primary attestation (NHC II,1)',1,false,false,'First of the twelve rulers under Yaldabaoth, ''whom the generations call the reaper,'' in the Apocryphon of John (NHC II,1).','demon'),
